%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App as Dev backend
  participant Adapter as AuthAdapter
  participant SDK as Junjo SDK
  participant Server as junjo-server (Hono)
  participant DB as Postgres (via Prisma)

  Note over App,DB: Phase 1 - resolve session token to external user id (dev's host, never on Junjo's server)
  App->>SDK: junjo.whoami(sessionToken)
  alt no authAdapter configured
    SDK--xApp: throw JunjoError invalid_config (setup-time mistake)
  else authAdapter present
    SDK->>Adapter: verifyToken(sessionToken)
    alt verifies (signature, exp, iss, aud, claim)
      Adapter-->>SDK: { userId: externalUserId }
      SDK-->>App: { userId: externalUserId }
    else missing, expired, bad signature, network error
      Adapter-->>SDK: null
      SDK-->>App: null
    end
  end

  Note over App,DB: Phase 2 - SDK call carrying the external user id (e.g. accept invitation)
  App->>SDK: junjo.invitations.accept(code, { userId: externalUserId })
  SDK->>Server: POST /v1/invitations/{code}/accept<br/>Authorization Bearer jk_...<br/>body { userId: externalUserId }
  Server->>DB: SELECT ApiKey WHERE prefix
  DB-->>Server: gameId, hashedSecret, revokedAt
  Server->>Server: scrypt verify, check revokedAt<br/>set c.var.gameId
  Server->>Server: zod-parse body, load invitation by code

  Note over App,DB: Phase 3 - external id resolved to junjoUserId (race-safe, created lazily on accept or decline)
  Server->>DB: SELECT ExternalIdentity WHERE gameId, externalUserId
  alt mapping exists
    DB-->>Server: junjoUserId
  else first appearance for this game
    DB-->>Server: null
    Server->>DB: BEGIN<br/>INSERT JunjoUser<br/>INSERT ExternalIdentity (gameId, junjoUserId, externalUserId)<br/>COMMIT
    alt insert wins (no concurrent first-appearance)
      DB-->>Server: junjoUserId (just created)
    else unique-constraint conflict P2002 (concurrent winner committed)
      DB--xServer: rollback inner tx
      Server->>DB: SELECT ExternalIdentity WHERE gameId, externalUserId
      DB-->>Server: winner's junjoUserId
    end
  end

  Server->>DB: route's main transaction<br/>INSERT GroupMember (groupId, junjoUserId)<br/>UPDATE Invitation SET usedAt, usedByUserId<br/>INSERT AuditEntry member.joined
  DB-->>Server: row counts
  Server-->>SDK: 201 Created + Member
  SDK-->>App: Member

  Note over App,DB: Read-only routes (members.get, permissions.check) take the external id and<br/>call findJunjoUserId only, returning 404 when no mapping exists. Only invitation<br/>accept and decline call findOrCreateJunjoUser, so a user's junjoUserId is allocated<br/>exactly when they first interact with a group on that game.
